msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Tell me about Morrigan Thultris"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3583
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "She does medical research here"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3584
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "May I speak with her?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3585
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"She won't come to the communications nexus, but you may visit her in her "
"quarters"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3586
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Visit Dr. Thultris"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3587
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris behind closed quarters door]\n"
"Who is it?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3588
#, lua-format
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "I am an officer from the Human Navy ship, %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3589
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris behind closed quarters door]\n"
"What do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3590
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "We need your help"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3592
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris opens her door]\n"
"With what?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3593 scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3669
#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3711 scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3749
#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3787
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "Grab Dr. Thultris"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3595 scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3633
#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3671 scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3713
#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3751 scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3789
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"As you pull her down the corridor back to the ship, explaining why you've "
"come for her, she protests initially then eventually runs back with you, "
"convinced of the urgency of the situation"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3599 scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3637
#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3675 scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3717
#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3755 scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3793
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "She slams the door in your face as you reach for her"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3603
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "A dying patient needs your expertise"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3605
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] Then let's get going to help the patient\n"
"\n"
"As you both return, you explain the situation to her"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3609
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"People die all the time\n"
"[Dr. Thultris closes her door]"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3613
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid "An Arlenian Admiral shows symptoms like those you published"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_49_allies.lua:3615
msgctxt "doctor-comms"
msgid ""
"[Dr. Thultris] Take me to the admiral\n"
"\n"
"As you both return to the ship, you explain the situation to her"
